@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
title SVG 编辑器 CLI — 模块与依赖方向（一类一文件）

package "cli（最外层）" {
  [main（bin 入口）]
  [CompositionRoot 组合根]
  [Repl]
}

package "app（用例编排）" {
  [CommandRunner]
  [EditorSession]
}

package "commands（Command 模式，19 个命令类）" {
  [CommandRegistry]
  [CommandSyntax]
  [CommandHistory]
  [InitCommand / CanvasCommand]
  [ReadCommand / SaveCommand]
  [CreateCommand / DeleteCommand]
  [MoveCommand / ScaleCommand / SetAttributeCommand]
  [GroupCommand / UngroupCommand / AddToCommand]
  [FrontCommand / BackCommand]
  [TreeCommand / ShowCommand / UndoCommand / RedoCommand / HelpCommand]
}

package "presentation（文本视图）" {
  [TreeRenderer]
  [TreeRow]
  [ShowRenderer]
}

package "domain（核心，只依赖 shared）" {
  [Shape]
  [Group «Composite»]
  [Rect / Circle /\nEllipse / Line / Text]
  [SvgDocument]
  [ShapeFactory]
  [DocumentMemento]
}

package "io（格式与文件）" {
  [SvgCodec]
  [SvgDecoder / SvgEncoder]
  [SvgXmlReader]
  [NodeFileGateway]
}

package "shared（端口与工具类）" {
  [EditorError]
  [Numbers / Xml / Tokenizer / Arguments]
  [FileGateway «port»]
  [DocumentCodec «port»]
}

main（bin 入口） --> CompositionRoot 组合根
CompositionRoot 组合根 --> Repl
CompositionRoot 组合根 --> EditorSession
CompositionRoot 组合根 --> SvgCodec
CompositionRoot 组合根 --> NodeFileGateway
Repl --> CommandRunner
CommandRunner --> CommandRegistry
CommandRunner --> CommandHistory
CommandRunner --> EditorSession
EditorSession ..|> CommandContext
MoveCommand / ScaleCommand / SetAttributeCommand --> Shape
GroupCommand / UngroupCommand / AddToCommand --> Shape
CreateCommand / DeleteCommand --> Shape
TreeCommand / ShowCommand / UndoCommand / RedoCommand / HelpCommand --> TreeRenderer
CommandRegistry --> CommandSyntax
SvgCodec ..|> DocumentCodec
NodeFileGateway ..|> FileGateway
SvgDecoder --> ShapeFactory
Group «Composite» --> Shape
SvgDocument --> Shape
TreeRenderer --> Shape
ShowRenderer --> Shape

note right of commands
  依赖方向：commands 只依赖 domain、presentation 与端口，
  不 import io / app / cli —— 因此图中
  commands 与 io 之间没有箭头。
end note

note bottom of domain
  domain 不依赖任何上层模块；
  这是整个架构的依赖汇点，
  也是唯一可以在没有 fs / 终端的情况下测试的层。
end note

note bottom of presentation
  presentation 位于 domain 之上、commands/io 之下：
  纯渲染、无副作用，可供两处复用。
end note

@enduml
